     A*
     A*  Matrix Claims Eligibility File
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  Created on 01/23/2003 by C:62 for Project:114MEK
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  Purpose: This file is extracted from WCMS claims selecting
     A*           open claims and claims which have been reopened/
     A*           closed within the specified date range.  It will be
     A*           used by Mx to determine whether a Claimant's
     A*           monthly prescriptions are for their Injury, or other
     A*           medical issues outside of the On the Job Injury
     A*           and/or WC Coverage.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 06/02/14 C:212  Project 114MLK                                *
     A*                 Add field for ICD 10 code                   *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 03/19/2004 c:62 Project 114MHG                                *
     A*                 Add Policy# and Agent# fields                 *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PCE01                     TEXT('Claimant Eligibility File')
     A            CEFND          3S 0       COLHDG('Group')
     A            CEFNAM        60A         COLHDG('Group Name')
     A            CECLM#        11A         COLHDG('Claim Number')
     A            CELSN         30A         COLHDG('Claimant Last Name')
     A            CEFSN         15A         COLHDG('Claimant First Name')
     A            CESS#          9A         COLHDG('Claimant SS#')
     A            CEACDT         8S 0       COLHDG('Accident Date')
     A            CEDIAG         6A         COLHDG('Diagnosis code')
     A            CECLDT         8S 0       COLHDG('Close Date of Claim')
     A            CEADR1        40A         COLHDG('Claimant Address 1')
     A            CEADR2        40A         COLHDG('Claimant Address 2')
     A            CECTY         25A         COLHDG('Claimant City')
     A            CEST           2A         COLHDG('Claimant State')
     A            CEZIP          9S 0       COLHDG('Claimant Zip Code')
     A            CENRSE         3A         COLHDG('Case Manager')
     A            CENRSN        50A         COLHDG('Case Manager Name')
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 03/19/04 **************************************
     A            CEPOL#    R               REFFLD(DS25)
     A                                      COLHDG('Policy Number')
     A            CEAGT#    R     S         REFFLD(AGT#)
     A                                      COLHDG('Agent Number')
     A*** END   ADD *** 03/19/04 **************************************
     A***** BEG ADD *** 06/02/14 **************************************
     A            CEICD1001      8A         COLHDG('ICD-10 CODE')
